          {
           "key": "learn",
           "variable": {
            "entries": [
             {
              "key": "howCommands",
              "variable": {
               "entries": [
                {
                 "key": "emoji",
                 "variable": {
                  "textValue": "📘",
                  "variableType": 2,
                  "type": "StringValue"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                },
                {
                 "key": "title",
                 "variable": {
                  "textValue": "How+to+add+your+own+commands+(Action+group:+Commands)",
                  "variableType": 2,
                  "type": "StringValue"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                },
                {
                 "key": "steps",
                 "variable": {
                  "entries": [
                   {
                    "key": "0",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Open+the+<strong>Commands</strong>+action+group.+Add+a+condition+that+checks+the+incoming+message:<div+class=\"code-chunk\">lastMessage+=+/command_name</div>For+example,+for+the+<code>/start</code>+command+→+<code>lastMessage+=+/start</code>.",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "1",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Inside+the+condition,+add+the+<code>TgBotCommandsAddList</code>+block+to+add+the+command+to+the+bot+menu,+and+fill+in:<br><b>Input+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>command</code>+–+the+command+name+(without+<code>/</code>)+(e.g.,+<code>start</code>)</li><li><code>description</code>+–+the+command+description+(e.g.,+<code>Start+the+bot</code>)</li><li><code>uniqueNum</code>+–+unique+number+(optional)<ul><li>Used+for+sorting+during+registration</li><li>Must+not+duplicate+numbers+of+other+commands</li><li>Can+be+left+empty+(it+will+be+generated+automatically)</li></ul></li><li><code>commandsDict</code>+–+the+command+registry+dictionary.+Always+pass+the+<code>commands</code>+dictionary.</li></ul><b>Output+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>newCommandsDict</code>+–+the+command+registry+dictionary+including+the+new+command.</li></ul><div+class=\"desc\">⚠️+The+command+will+appear+in+the+Telegram+menu+only+after+you+<strong>manually+send+it+once</strong>+to+the+bot+in+chat.</div>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "2",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Below+the+<code>TgBotCommandsAddList</code>+block,+add+your+functionality+–+the+actions+that+should+be+executed+when+the+command+is+sent+to+the+bot.",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "3",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "To+reply+to+the+user,+call+the+<code>TgBotMessageSend</code>+block+and+set+the+parameters:<br><b>Input+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>apiToken</code>+–+your+Telegram+bot+API+token.</li><li><code>chatId</code>+–+the+chat+ID+where+the+message+will+be+sent.+You+can+use+the+<code>chatId</code>+variable.</li><li><code>text</code>+–+the+message+text.</li><li><code>inlineKeyboard</code>+–+array+of+buttons+(inline+keyboard).+Built+using+the+<code>TgBotCallbackAddList</code>+block.</li></ul><b>Output+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>responseBodyDict</code>+–+dictionary+with+the+Telegram+API+response+(data+about+the+sent+message).</li></ul>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "4",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "If+you+need+buttons+under+the+message+(inline+keyboard),+add+them+using+<code>TgBotCallbackAddList</code>.<br>Each+call+of+the+block+adds+one+button+to+the+array.+To+create+multiple+buttons,+call+the+block+several+times,+passing+the+same+array+as+the+<code>callbackArrayDict</code>+input.<br>Then+this+array+must+be+passed+to+<code>TgBotMessageSend</code>+or+<code>TgBotMessageEdit</code>.<br><b>Input+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>callbackArrayDict</code>+–+the+current+inline+keyboard+array.+For+the+first+button,+pass+an+empty+array.</li><li><code>text</code>+–+the+text+on+the+button.</li><li><code>callbackData</code>+–+the+data+that+will+be+sent+when+the+button+is+pressed+(string+for+<code>callback_query</code>).</li></ul><b>Output+variables:</b><br><ul><li><code>newCallbackArrayDict</code>+–+the+updated+array+including+the+new+button.+It+must+be+passed+to+<code>TgBotMessageSend</code>+or+<code>TgBotMessageEdit</code>+as+the+<code>inlineKeyboard</code>+parameter.</li></ul>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   }
                  ],
                  "isArray": true,
                  "variableType": 5,
                  "type": "Dictionary"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                }
               ],
               "isArray": false,
               "variableType": 4,
               "type": "Dictionary"
              },
