             },
             {
              "key": "i18nIntro",
              "variable": {
               "entries": [
                {
                 "key": "emoji",
                 "variable": {
                  "textValue": "🌍",
                  "variableType": 2,
                  "type": "StringValue"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                },
                {
                 "key": "title",
                 "variable": {
                  "textValue": "How+to+add+string+translations+and+new+languages",
                  "variableType": 2,
                  "type": "StringValue"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                },
                {
                 "key": "steps",
                 "variable": {
                  "entries": [
                   {
                    "key": "0",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "All+translations+are+collected+in+the+<code>langs</code>+variable.<ul><li>It+is+a+dictionary</li><li>It+has+language+keys:+<code>ru</code>,+<code>en</code>,+<code>de</code>,+and+others.</li><li>Each+language+is+a+nested+dictionary:<ul><li><code>key</code>+=+the+string+in+English+(original).</li><li><code>value</code>+=+the+translation+of+that+string+into+the+selected+language.</li></ul></li></ul>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "1",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Adding+a+translation+for+an+existing+language<ul><li>Open+the+<code>langs</code>+variable.</li><li>Choose+the+language,+for+example+<code>ru</code>.</li><li>Open+the+list+of+strings+inside.</li><li>Add+a+new+pair:<ul><li><code>key</code>+=+English+text+(original).</li><li><code>value</code>+=+translation+into+that+language.</li></ul></li></ul>✅+Example:<br>In+<code>langs.ru</code>+add:<div+class=\"code-chunk\">\"Settings\"+:+\"Настройки\"</div>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "2",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Adding+a+new+language.<ul><li>In+the+<code>langs</code>+variable,+pick+an+existing+language+(e.g.,+<code>en</code>).</li><li>Copy+the+whole+entry.</li><li>Create+a+new+entry+and+name+it+with+the+language+code+(e.g.,+<code>fr</code>+for+French).</li><li>Translate+all+the+values+into+the+new+language.<ul><li>Keys+remain+in+English.</li><li>Translate+values+only.</li></ul></li></ul>✅+Example:<div+class=\"code-chunk\">\"fr\"+:+{\"Settings\"+:+\"Paramètres\",+\"Help\"+:+\"Aide\"}</div>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   },
                   {
                    "key": "3",
                    "variable": {
                     "textValue": "Recommendations<ul><li>Make+sure+keys+match+across+languages+(otherwise+the+translation+won\"t+be+found).</li><li>For+consistency,+use+<b>ISO+language+codes</b>+(<code>ru</code>,+<code>en</code>,+<code>de</code>,+<code>fr</code>,+<code>es</code>).</li><li>Add+new+strings+to+all+languages+at+once,+even+if+the+translation+isn\"t+ready+yet+(you+can+temporarily+leave+English).</li></ul>",
                     "variableType": 2,
                     "type": "StringValue"
                    },
                    "variableType": 11,
                    "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                   }
                  ],
                  "isArray": true,
                  "variableType": 5,
                  "type": "Dictionary"
                 },
                 "variableType": 11,
                 "type": "DictionaryEntry"
                }
