        {
         "key": "FirstStartDialog",
         "variable": {
          "textValue": "<b>🛠+How+to+Set+Up</b>\n\n1.+<b>Open+Telegram</b>+and+search+for+<b>@BotFather</b>\n2.+Send+the+command:+<code>/newbot</code>\n3.+Follow+the+steps:+enter+your+<b>bot+name</b>+and+<b>username</b>\n4.+Copy+the+provided+<b>API+Token</b>\n5.+Paste+it+into+the+<code>apiToken</code>+variable+in+your+macro+script\n\n<b>🔐+API+Integration:</b>\n\n•+<b>VirusTotal</b>:+get+your+API+key+from+<a+href=\"https://www.virustotal.com/\">virustotal.com</a>\n•+<b>DeepSeek</b>:+register+at+<a+href=\"https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324\">openrouter.ai</a>\n•+Insert+both+keys+into+your+macro+variables\n\n<b>📎+More+about+the+macro:</b>\n<a+href=\"https://github.com/BespredeL/MacroDroid/\">GitHub</a>+|+<a+href=\"https://4pda.to/forum/index.php?showtopic=796731&view=findpost&p=136381928\">4PDA</a>+|+<a+href=\"https://www.macrodroidforum.com/index.php?threads/simple-telegram-bot.10087/\">MacroDroid+Forum</a>",
