        {
         "key": "FirstStartDialog",
         "variable": {
          "textValue": "<b>🛠+봇+만들기</b>\n<br>\n1.+<b>Telegram을+열고</b>+<b><a+href=\"https://t.me/BotFather\">@BotFather</a></b>를+찾습니다<br>\n2.+명령어를+보냅니다:+<code>/newbot</code><br>\n3.+지시에+따라+<b>봇+이름</b>과+<b>사용자+이름</b>을+입력합니다<br>\n4.+발급된+<b>API+토큰</b>을+복사합니다<br>\n5.+토큰을+<code>Telegram+API+token</code>+필드에+붙여넣습니다\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>🔐+API+서비스+연결:</b>\n<br>\n•+<b>VirusTotal</b>:+<a+href=\"https://www.virustotal.com/\">virustotal.com</a>에서+API+키를+받으세요\n<br>\n•+키를+<code>VirusTotal+API+token</code>+필드에+붙여넣으세요\n<br>\n<br>\n•+<b>DeepSeek</b>:+<a+href=\"https://openrouter.ai/deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324\">openrouter.ai</a>에서+키를+등록하세요\n<br>\n•+키를+<code>OpenRoute+API+token</code>+필드에+붙여넣으세요\n<br>\n<br>\n<b>📎+매크로+더+알아보기:</b>\n<br>\n<a+href=\"https://github.com/BespredeL/MacroDroid/\">GitHub</a>+|+<a+href=\"https://4pda.to/forum/index.php?showtopic=796731&view=findpost&p=136381928\">4PDA</a>+|+<a+href=\"https://www.macrodroidforum.com/index.php?threads/simple-telegram-bot.10087/\">MacroDroid+Forum</a>",
          "variableType": 2,
